  "description": "Retrospective application for the installation of an external kitchen extraction system including an Etaline 250 fan, associated ductwork, and rear flue at 101 Tower Bridge Road, London SE1 4TW.\nThe proposal includes modifications to raise the flue to at least 1 metre above the level of the rear dormer roof window and the addition of a jet cowl for vertical discharge, to mitigate noise and odour impact on neighbouring properties.\nThe system is designed to serve the ground floor restaurant (King of Falafel) and includes anti-vibration mounts and filters to address environmental health concerns.",
